/ region 260-301
/ mpy.c lowered by hand. BYNAME functions: the first read of the by-name
/ parameter is the return cell R (an `xct` homed on the inline word);
/ later reads are `xct R`; returns are `jmp i R`; the skip `idx R` goes at
/ the first boundary after the last by-name read that dominates the return
/ and has AC dead (RETURN-SKIP).
